{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pinball With A Gun,</strong> your job is to simply play pinball like you normally would. <strong>Don't tell anybody where you are,</strong> it'll be totally fine! Nobody's even watching! If you <i>must</i>, invite your besties for some friendly competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step up, pull that plunger, and pray you make it to the next round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566120/extras/4cea9d4eb1b5b6e312bd009f6925699c.avif?t=1774198913\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Tournament F.A.Q.</strong>   <br>  <br><strong>&quot;What if I get shot in the head?&quot;</strong> That's a weird question! You're weird for asking! That <i>barely </i>even happens in Pinball! Why don't you focus on <i>playing</i>, and not pivoting to ridiculous, unrelated questions!  <br>  <br><strong>&quot;What is this tournament? Why are you doing this? Help me!&quot;</strong> There are <strong>no </strong>secrets in this game, and getting a high score will <strong>not </strong>reveal anything to you. Do <strong>not </strong>attempt to leave the machine. <strong>You </strong>worry about having fun, and let <strong>the machine</strong> do the rest!  <br>  <br>&quot;<strong>Can I play this on Steam Deck?</strong>&quot; Pinball with a Gun is optimized to run great on a Steam Deck! Pinball with a Gun is available on Windows, Linux/SteamOS, and Mac. It can also be played with a controller or keyboard and mouse.   <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566120/extras/66a516e30875855fe2bfd9905eb1f7f5.avif?t=1774198913\" width=308 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;What if I shake the machine?&quot;</strong> For our legal safety, we are required to inform you that we cannot guarantee your safety in the event of a shaken machine. But it's not like there are cops around, so do whatever you want!  <br>  <br>&quot;<strong>Who am I playing against?</strong>&quot; Don't worry about that. Feel free to come to the tournament alone, or you can bring your friends for online multiplayer. You can also compete against the world and your friends on the Infinite Tournament Leaderboards! Walloo!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566120/extras/1f5ed4118a17c8dded48ec2a8f6e458f.avif?t=1774198913\" width=308 height=263 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566120?t=1774198913","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566120?t=1774198913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566120/7011fdb9c421889eee964e75a67ef832d968c529/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774198913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566120/7011fdb9c421889eee964e75a67ef832d968c529/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774198913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo So